OL,3,GNEWSAMan in 50s dies in motorway crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA section of the M2 in Kent remains
OL,6,Fclosed in both directions following a
OL,7,Fcrash in which a man has died,
OL,8,Faccording to police.
OL,10,FKent Police said the motorway was
OL,11,Fclosed after a pedestrian in his 50s
OL,12,Fwas struck by multiple vehicles.
OL,14,FOfficers said the crash happened just
OL,15,Fafter 21:00 GMT on Tuesday on the
OL,16,Fcoastbound carriageway near Medway
OL,17,FServices, with the force warning that
OL,18,Fthe road would remain closed for "a
OL,19,Fsignificant period of time".
OL,21,FThe man's next of kin has been
OL,22,Finformed, Kent Police said.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
